			<div class="content" id="post-content-3860932">
									

<p>Welcome to We Have Assumed Control by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/armlengthradius" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1966630); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1966630&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532651287" alt="ArmLengthRadius" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1966630)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/armlengthradius" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1966630); return false;">ArmLengthRadius</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gibberingeloquence" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1421648); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1421648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532651287" alt="GibberingEloquence" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1421648)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gibberingeloquence" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1421648); return false;">GibberingEloquence</a></span>.</p>
<p>Firstly, thanks are in order. I'd like to personally thank my running mate Gib, who has undoubtably chosen to undersell his participation in the text. I'd also like to thank both Zyn and Dr. Everwood for the helpful words of advice. And to you, who's reading our article.</p>
<p>EDIT: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2858989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532651287" alt="Westrin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2858989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;">Westrin</a></span> had some fine ideas about the fine tuning of our formatting, mad credit.</p>
<p>EDIT 2: We now have a <a href="/the-voyage">tale</a>! Maybe come check it out.</p>
<p>Sometimes perfection requires a caressing hand and not a calculated scalpel.</p>
<p>From Gib:</p>
<p>&quot;Big kudos to ArmLengthRadius for writing most of the article and being a supportive person. Hope you all like it, and don't forget to check out Rush's songs, which were a big inspiration!&quot;</p>

